{"data":{"id":"rArFgpiAq7k","slug":"bilal","title":"Bilal","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"KwsGRzPszfg","slug":"checkin-u-out","title":"Checkin' U Out"},{"id":"W-a8lstnQJw","slug":"reminisce","title":"Reminisce"},{"id":"Sfau1PeOejQ","slug":"sweet-sour-you","title":"Sweet Sour You"},{"id":"kAV0IjUgwRE","slug":"get-out-of-my-hair","title":"Get Out Of My Hair"},{"id":"7vuy11Tjc3s","slug":"soul-sista","title":"Soul Sista"},{"id":"pERWLZJAdS0","slug":"reminisce-feat-mos-def-and-common","title":"Reminisce (feat. Mos Def & Common)"},{"id":"ZFnjk1bZahY","slug":"longing-and-waiting","title":"Longing and Waiting"}]},"markers":[{"id":"kAg0ZWSVOLY","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Bilal - Checkin' U Out","track":{"id":"KwsGRzPszfg","path":"/artists/bilal/tracks/checkin-u-out/","slug":"checkin-u-out","title":"Checkin' U Out","artist":{"slug":"bilal","title":"Bilal"},"artwork":"images/artists/bilal/tracks/checkin-u-out.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"brFh4QBhAJE","slug":"167","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-167"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #167","artwork":"/images/episodes/167.jpg","content":"Take a deep breath and slow things down with Joe Kay\n<!--more-->\n\nSo many good things have been going on in our world but sometimes it is overwhelming. However we just take a deep breath and keep it moving. This week Joe Kay wanted to slow things down a bit and just focus on the music by going solo. Joe started off with some nice neo-soul/Dilla-esque vibes and then progressed into some progressive beats to get your energy flowing. Standout artists to look out for are LOSCO. These guys have a heavy, heavy sound. Just wait til you hear. As the show progressed the engagement via social media was massive and a few people randomly requested to hear a Sango tribute so we did one! Joe dropped a 42 minute set of primarily unreleased music to keep things interesting! We hope you enjoy the show and feel free to spread it to as many people as possible. Real radio is here.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10845,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"LNu0duwyu8Q","position":11,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Bilal - Reminisce","track":{"id":"W-a8lstnQJw","path":"/artists/bilal/tracks/reminisce/","slug":"reminisce","title":"Reminisce","artist":{"slug":"bilal","title":"Bilal"},"artwork":"images/artists/bilal/tracks/reminisce.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"LGEeuVvtaVY","position":24,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Bilal - Sweet Sour You","track":{"id":"Sfau1PeOejQ","path":"/artists/bilal/tracks/sweet-sour-you/","slug":"sweet-sour-you","title":"Sweet Sour You","artist":{"slug":"bilal","title":"Bilal"},"artwork":"images/artists/bilal/tracks/sweet-sour-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"W3k2t5eT5Eo","slug":"170","tags":[5,1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-170-w-eden-hagos-andre-power"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #170 w/ Eden Hagos & Andre Power","artwork":"/images/episodes/170.jpg","content":"Andre Power covers while Joe Kay is at Coachella.\n<!--more-->\n\nThese two did a great job of playing a variety of soulful classics along with new discoveries. This show is definitely on that deep thought vibe. Joe will be back this Saturday to continue on the progression. Spread the word, tell a friend.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10900,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andre Power's Set","position":1}},{"id":"WJl7fX6450A","position":100,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Bilal - Get Out Of My Hair","track":{"id":"kAV0IjUgwRE","path":"/artists/bilal/tracks/get-out-of-my-hair/","slug":"get-out-of-my-hair","title":"Get Out Of My Hair","artist":{"slug":"bilal","title":"Bilal"},"artwork":"images/artists/bilal/tracks/get-out-of-my-hair.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"8fbMb_M2jAg","slug":"240","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-240/ra.1081635248","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-240-soulection-family-new-years-special"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #240 (Soulection Family New Year's Special)","artwork":"/images/episodes/240.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10972,"location":"US","published_at":"2016-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"DkYu6gWP5ms","position":101,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"B