ista","track":{"id":"7vuy11Tjc3s","path":"/artists/bilal/tracks/soul-sista/","slug":"soul-sista","title":"Soul Sista","artist":{"slug":"bilal","title":"Bilal"},"artwork":"images/artists/bilal/tracks/soul-sista.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A0JxKsQecBg","slug":"445","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-445/ra.1501053117","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-445"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #445","artwork":"images/episodes/445.png","content":"\nIt's just Joe, the music, and you.\n<!--more-->","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-02-29T13:44:36+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"eaQ-X485_Fo","position":23,"timestamp":"00:51:20","rawTrack":"Bilal - Reminisce (feat. Mos Def & Common)","track":{"id":"pERWLZJAdS0","path":"/artists/bilal/tracks/reminisce-feat-mos-def-common/","slug":"reminisce-feat-mos-def-and-common","title":"Reminisce (feat. Mos Def & Common)","artist":{"slug":"bilal","title":"Bilal"},"artwork":"images/artists/bilal/tracks/reminisce-feat-mos-def-common.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"cGsNf0qPhRw","slug":"449","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-449/ra.1505066754","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-449-ft-olea"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #449 w/ Olea","artwork":"images/episodes/449.png","content":"Joe Kay, [Olea](https://twitter.com/olea_5), The Music and You.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nMusic is a gift of life, You could be anywhere in the world, but you're here with us Today.\n\nRemain positive, focused, slow down and breath. \n\n👁️‍🗨️ 🕊️ Stay safe, Stay in, Stay soulful\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-03-28T17:05:51+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"lVc7--fNv64","position":13,"timestamp":"00:28:21","rawTrack":"Bilal - Soul